OL,3,GNEWSARiver levels 'exceptionally low'
OL,4,Aas drought bites
OL,5,
OL,6,FRivers in Devon and Cornwall have
OL,7,Fdropped to "exceptionally low" levels
OL,8,Fin places, after the prolonged hot, dry
OL,9,Fweather, the Environment Agency (EA)
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FAt Trews Weir on the Exe in Exeter,
OL,13,FAtlantic salmon are struggling to
OL,14,Fmigrate upstream to spawn due to the
OL,15,F"lowest flows ever recorded", said Tim
OL,16,Fde Winton, from the EA.
OL,18,FThousands of fish have also been
OL,19,Frescued from rivers that were drying
OL,20,Fup, following reports of them being in
OL,21,Fdistress at sites across the two
OL,22,Fcounties.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
