OL,3,GNEWSARiver levels 'exceptionally low'
OL,4,Aas drought bites
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall are in drought, a
OL,7,Fhosepipe ban is in place and there are
OL,8,Fcontinued warnings over the risk of
OL,9,Fwildfires.
